ISO-10303-21;
/* Pmi039: Two PLUS_MINUS_TOLERANCE entities both point at the same DIMENSIONAL_SIZE; AP242 RP requires exactly one plus_minus_tolerance per dimensional_size; receivers must warn and normalize to the first entry deterministically; silently accepting duplicate tolerances is forbidden; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty */
